{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Vivica listens, letting Sabrine speak as much as she want. She won't pry past what is freely being said","created_at":"2021-08-18T16:54:35.094000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877596351268012033","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she turns around to look at the pair of them.\n'If... s-someone, who's a stranger to you now... k-killed someone you care about in a-an accident... b-but... just fled... ran away to forget... what would you do?'","created_at":"2021-08-18T16:56:41.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877596881943928853","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'd want to find them at the very least. But like you said, it was an accident. Not sure where it would go from there besides asking why\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T16:58:22.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877597306503962675","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...why they fled? Cowardice.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T16:58:38.194000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877597370903318608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Vivica thinks \"There is probably a few ways I would handle it... well as a Lamplighter I would definitely try to find the person responsible, but I also believe in restorative justice. I would like to hear their side of the story for sure..I don't know if I'd be able to forgive them, that depends on the variables of the situation I think.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:00:02.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877597724608958565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I would have an easier time forgiving them if I knew they were truly sorry and regretfully of their actions.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:01:06.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877597991060504576","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He points to vivvy\n\"What she said\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:01:27.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877598079082168320","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...so if, some five, ten years later... you found that they were trying to atone for the accident... what then? Would that... make them worthy of forgiveness?'","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:01:47.790000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877598166126559325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't think its a question of being worthy of forgiveness or not. I think its more about how they have changed and are trying to attone or set things right. What impact are they making now. Forgiveness comes from the person or persons harmed and that happens through their own process of healing.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:05:06.351000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-18T17:07:49.227000Z","id":"877598998951755837","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods weakly. 'I see... o-on a d-di-different note. I... how do I forgive myself for forgetting her?'","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:07:04.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877599493548302428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'My w-world was shattered, I ran f-from it to s-survive... but if I h-had stayed... maybe I could h-have helped. And even if not... I c-chose to forget. To m-make things easier f-for me.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:08:25.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877599836290056292","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Can you really blame yourself for something your brain cannot access like a memory?\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:08:49.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877599936626196500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'You d-don't understand. I... sold my s-soul to this ***Thing*** so I c-could forget.' her words come out fast and harder to comprehend.","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:09:54.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877600205497843722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Vivica tires to calm Sabrine down and pulls her in closer \"We all make choices we regret in the long run. Its easy in the moment to ask to forget when the pain feels too hard to deal with.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:12:05.543000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877600757170442290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I made a choice to forget something because I couldn't deal with it either, but maybe that was just the easy route..\" she sighs \"maybe it wasn't the right choice but in times of great pain, who can really be blamed for wanting to forget.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:13:51.507000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877601201615683675","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...me. I can be blamed. Not you, but I can.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:14:46.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877601433535533136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What makes it so different. We both made a choice to forget something painful  no?\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:15:42.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877601667502198804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Your pain, if it's what I think it is, wasn't your fault.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:15:58.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877601733986095224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Vivica pulls back to look Sab in the eye, she thinks she understands now what your saying \"You Sabrine are not a bad person for trying to forget something that hurt you. I may have not known you then but I know you now. You are a good, sweet, funny, kind, and amazing person who always wants to help people.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:18:08.576000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877602279841218610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Everyone has made mistakes with consequences we never saw coming, but what about that makes you a bad person? If you know now, and are trying to do something about it dont blame yourself for time lost when you didn't know.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T17:20:42.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877602927492096090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
